OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance launches appeal
OL,4,Aafter #1.1m deficit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn air ambulance charity has launched
OL,7,Fan appeal for public support after
OL,8,Freporting a #1.1m deficit in its latest
OL,9,Fannual report.
OL,11,FDevon Air Ambulance attended more than
OL,12,F2,100 emergencies last year but rising
OL,13,Foperating costs and reduced legacy
OL,14,Fincome had left it spending more than
OL,15,Fit receives, according to the charity.
OL,17,FA spokesperson said there was no
OL,18,Fimmediate threat to front-line services
OL,19,Fbut a further deficit had been forecast
OL,20,Ffor next year despite measures expected
OL,21,Fto save about #400,000 annually.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
