OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance launches appeal
OL,4,Aafter #1.1m deficit
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are determined to protect
OL,7,Ffront-line patient care, but we cannot
OL,8,Fdo this alone," said director of
OL,9,Fcorporate services Dave Hawes.
